<!--
four types of the command can be defined now

sci:static class invoke
ici:instance class invoke
cic:cross invoke
pic:process invoke
 -->

<!--
security info

name            present                            value
"security"     securityType                0 always not allowed, 1 always allowed, 2 moi realated, 3 moi not related.
"moiIDorAppID"   moi object ID or appID
"accessID"        access ID

notice , the previous defined as below.but iMap1.5 changed the security information to only moiIDorAppID and accessID.
so iVIEW security informatio changed to above information.

name            present                            value
"security"     securityType                0 always not allowed, 1 always allowed, 2 moi realated, 3 moi not related.
"moiID"        moi object ID
"appID"        application object ID
"oprID"        operation ID
-->
